  "label": "Sexual Assault Allegation",
  "description": "A sexual assault allegation is a claim that someone has been sexually assaulted. In the context of the meme, it refers to the allegations made by Christine Blasey Ford against Brett Kavanaugh during his Supreme Court confirmation hearings. The meme uses the term 'shit that never happened' to mock Kavanaugh's denial of the allegations and to imply that he is willing to accept a false accusation for money.",
